<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Names shown on BOTH the phone and the watch, so they live in the shared module rather
  than being duplicated in each. Sect and madhab names stay in app/values/strings.xml
  because only the phone ever shows them.

  Translators: these are the most sensitive strings in the app. Prayer names are usually
  left as the Arabic transliteration even in translated apps (Urdu and Indonesian users
  expect "Fajr", not a local translation of "dawn"), so change them only on the advice of
  a native speaker. Calculation methods are the names of real organisations and mostly
  should not be translated at all.
-->
